<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>한국전력공사 성과보상체계 개선 방안</title>
    
    <!-- Fonts & Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    
    <!-- Library CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/fullPage.js/4.0.20/fullpage.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/aos/2.3.4/aos.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.css" />

    <!-- Library JS -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/fullPage.js/4.0.20/fullpage.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/aos/2.3.4/aos.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/typed.js@2.1.0/dist/typed.umd.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --kepco-blue: #005088;
            --kepco-red: #ED1C24;
            --dark-blue: #0A2540;
            --bg-light: #F8FAFC;
            --bg-dark: #0F172A;
            --text-dark: #1E293B;
            --text-muted: #64748B;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* 16:9 Aspect Ratio / Responsive Mixture Container */
        .slide-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1440px;
            height: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 60px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .slide-container {
                padding: 20px;
            }
        }

        /* Section Backgrounds */
        .section {
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section.bg-dark {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .section.bg-blue {
            background-color: var(--kepco-blue);
            color: var(--white);
        }

        .section.bg-light {
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
        }

        /* Typography */
        .slide-header {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .slide-tag {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--kepco-red);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .slide-title {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: inherit;
        }
        
        .section.bg-light .slide-title {
            color: var(--dark-blue);
        }

        .slide-title span {
            color: var(--kepco-blue);
        }
        
        .section.bg-dark .slide-title span,
        .section.bg-blue .slide-title span {
            color: #38BDF8;
        }

        .slide-desc {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 15px;
            max-width: 800px;
        }
        
        .section.bg-dark .slide-desc,
        .section.bg-blue .slide-desc {
            color: #94A3B8;
        }

        /* Layout Grid System */
        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .grid-2, .grid-3 {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 20px;
            }
        }

        /* Hover Lift Cards Effect */
        .lift-card {
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1), box-shadow 0.4s ease, border-color 0.4s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
        }

        .lift-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-12px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 80, 136, 0.12);
            border-color: var(--kepco-blue);
        }

        .section.bg-dark .lift-card {
            background: #1E293B;
            border-color: #334155;
            color: var(--white);
        }
        
        .section.bg-dark .lift-card:hover {
            border-color: #38BDF8;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
        }

        .lift-card i {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--kepco-blue);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .section.bg-dark .lift-card i {
            color: #38BDF8;
        }

        .lift-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .lift-card p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        
        .section.bg-dark .lift-card p {
            color: #94A3B8;
        }

        /* Accordion / Toggle Elements */
        .accordion-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .accordion-item {
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .accordion-header {
            padding: 20px 25px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: var(--white);
            user-select: none;
        }

        .accordion-header:hover {
            background: #F1F5F9;
            color: var(--kepco-blue);
        }

        .accordion-content {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            background: #FAFCFF;
            border-top: 0 solid #E2E8F0;
        }

        .accordion-content-inner {
            padding: 25px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .accordion-item.active .accordion-content {
            border-top-width: 1px;
        }

        .accordion-item.active .accordion-header i {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
            color: var(--kepco-red);
        }

        .accordion-header i {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Hero / Introduction Specifics */
        .hero-flex {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .hero-text {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 800px;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 4.2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #94A3B8;
            margin-top: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* Swiper Carousel Customization */
        .swiper {
            width: 100%;
            padding-top: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .swiper-slide {
            width: 380px;
            height: auto;
        }

        .bench-slide-card {
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .bench-slide-card h4 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--dark-blue);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .bench-slide-card h4 i {
            color: var(--kepco-blue);
        }

        .bench-slide-card p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .company-tag {
            background: #E0F2FE;
            color: var(--kepco-blue);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        /* Charts styling */
        .chart-wrapper {
            background: var(--white);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
            position: relative;
            height: 380px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* Navigation Dots */
        #fp-nav ul li a span, .fp-slidesNav ul li a span {
            background: var(--kepco-blue) !important;
        }
        
        #fp-nav ul li a.active span, .fp-slidesNav ul li a.active span {
            background: var(--kepco-red) !important;
            transform: scale(1.3);
        }

        /* Section Divider / Chapter Slide */
        .chapter-number {
            font-size: 8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            position: absolute;
            top: 40px;
            right: 60px;
        }

        /* Bottom Status Bar */
        .slide-footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 30px;
            left: 60px;
            right: 60px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.4);
            padding-top: 15px;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .section.bg-dark .slide-footer, .section.bg-blue .slide-footer {
            color: #64748B;
            border-top-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }

        .footer-logo {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--kepco-blue);
        }
        .section.bg-dark .footer-logo, .section.bg-blue .footer-logo {
            color: var(--white);
        }

        /* Custom Bullet List */
        .bullet-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .bullet-list li {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 25px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .bullet-list li::before {
            content: "■";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--kepco-red);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            top: 2px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="fullpage">
        
        <!-- Slide 1: Title / Hero Slide -->
        <div class="section bg-dark" data-anchor="hero">
            <div class="slide-container">
                <div class="hero-flex">
                    <div class="hero-text">
                        <div class="slide-tag" data-aos="fade-down">KEPCO HR STRATEGY 2026</div>
                        <h1 class="hero-title"><span id="typed-title"></span></h1>
                        <p class="hero-subtitle">공정성 확보 및 성과 중심의 유연한 조직 문화 구축을 위한 다차원 보상 로드맵</p>
                        <div style="margin-top: 20px;" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
                            <button onclick="fullpage_api.moveSectionDown()" style="background: var(--kepco-blue); color: white; border: none; padding: 16px 35px; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
                                프레젠테이션 시작 <i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-footer">
                    <span class="footer-logo">한국전력공사</span>
                    <span>송변전직군 및 관리직 직무 보상 구조 개선안</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 2: Table of Contents -->
        <div class="section bg-light" data-anchor="toc">
            <div class="slide-container">
                <div class="slide-header" data-aos="fade-right">
                    <div class="slide-tag">목차</div>
                    <h2 class="slide-title">Contents <span>Agenda</span></h2>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-2">
                    <div class="accordion-wrapper" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <div class="lift-card" onclick="fullpage_api.moveTo(3)" style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 20px 30px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--kepco-red); margin-right: 15px;">01</strong> 검토 배경 및 목적 (조직 효과성과 공정성)
                        </div>
                        <div class="lift-card" onclick="fullpage_api.moveTo(5)" style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 20px 30px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--kepco-red); margin-right: 15px;">02</strong> 현행 성과보상체계 및 한계점 분석
                        </div>
                        <div class="lift-card" onclick="fullpage_api.moveTo(8)" style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 20px 30px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--kepco-red); margin-right: 15px;">03</strong> 글로벌 혁신 기업 및 공공기관 벤치마킹
                        </div>
                        <div class="lift-card" onclick="fullpage_api.moveTo(10)" style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 20px 30px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--kepco-red); margin-right: 15px;">04</strong> 비금전적·명예적 보상체계 다각화 방안
                        </div>
                        <div class="lift-card" onclick="fullpage_api.moveTo(12)" style="margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 20px 30px;">
                            <strong style="color: var(--kepco-red); margin-right: 15px;">05</strong> 기대효과 및 향후 실행 제언
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lift-card" data-aos="zoom-in" style="height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #005088 0%, #0A2540 100%); color: white;">
                        <h3 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">핵심 지향점</h3>
                        <p style="color: #94A3B8; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 25px;">
                            단순한 금전적 인센티브 차등을 넘어, 직무의 특성과 공정성 인식을 반영한 고도화된 인사 프레임워크를 수립합니다.
                        </p>
                        <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--kepco-red); padding-left: 15px; font-style: italic; color: #E2E8F0;">
                            "평가의 객관적 신뢰가 확보될 때 조직 구성원의 자발적 몰입이 일어납니다."
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-footer">
                    <span>AGENDA</span>
                    <span>02 / 12</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 3: Chapter 1 Intro -->
        <div class="section bg-blue" data-anchor="ch1">
            <div class="slide-container">
                <div class="chapter-number">CHAPTER 01</div>
                <div style="max-width: 700px;" data-aos="fade-right">
                    <div class="slide-tag" style="color: #38BDF8;">PART 01</div>
                    <h2 class="slide-title" style="font-size: 3.5rem; color: white;">검토 배경 및 목적</h2>
                    <p class="slide-desc" style="color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 25px;">
                        조직 공정성 인식이 구성원의 조직몰입과 성과상여금 만족도에 미치는 영향 분석 및 제도적 보완의 필요성 검토
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-footer">
                    <span>한국전력공사</span>
                    <span>03 / 12</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 4: Background - Academic Foundation -->
        <div class="section bg-light" data-anchor="background-theory">
            <div class="slide-container">
                <div class="slide-header" data-aos="fade-right">
                    <div class="slide-tag">이론적 배경 및 필요성</div>
                    <h2 class="slide-title">성과평가의 <span>공정성과 조직 효과성</span></h2>
                    <p class="slide-desc">기존 연구 및 실증 분석 자료에 따르면 성과 지하적 보상에서 가장 중요한 성공 요인은 '절차적·분배적 공정성'입니다.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-3">
                    <div class="lift-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <i class="fas fa-balance-scale"></i>
                        <h3>평가제도의 신뢰</h3>
                        <p>성과평가제도가 조직에 긍정적인 영향을 미치기 위해서는 객관성 확보를 통한 신뢰 형성이 필수적입니다.</p>
                        <span style="display:block; margin-top:15px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--kepco-blue); font-weight:600;">- 조희진 (2010)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lift-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <i class="fas fa-id-card-clip"></i>
                        <h3>조직 몰입의 정수</h3>
                        <p>개인별 성과보상 적정성과 분배의 공정성은 구성원의 심리적 안정감과 조직 몰입에 직접적인 유의한 영향을 미칩니다.</p>
                        <span style="display:block; margin-top:15px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--kepco-blue); font-weight:600;">- 인재만, 하규수 (2017)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lift-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <i class="fas fa-percentage"></i>
                        <h3>공정성 변수 영향력</h3>
                        <p>성과상여금 만족도에 가장 큰 결정 요인은 공정성(β = .347)으로 나타나, 단순 차등 폭보다 공정한 기준이 우선시됩니다.</p>
                        <span style="display:block; margin-top:15px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--kepco-blue); font-weight:600;">- 이희태 (2010)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-footer">
                    <span>BACKGROUND</span>
                    <span>04 / 12</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 5: Chapter 2 Intro -->
        <div class="section bg-blue" data-anchor="ch2">
            <div class="slide-container">
                <div class="chapter-number">CHAPTER 02</div>
                <div style="max-width: 700px;" data-aos="fade-right">
                    <div class="slide-tag" style="color: #38BDF8;">PART 02</div>
                    <h2 class="slide-title" style="font-size: 3.5rem; color: white;">현행 성과보상체계 분석</h2>
                    <p class="slide-desc" style="color: #E2E8F0; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 25px;">
                        한국전력공사 보수 규정 제3조 및 제4조에 기반한 성과연봉 지급 구조와 실제 운영 현황 파악
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-footer">
                    <span>한국전력공사</span>
                    <span>05 / 12</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Slide 6: Current State - Regulations -->
        <div class="section bg-light" data-anchor="regulations">
            <div class="slide-container">
                <div class="slide-header" data-aos="fade-right">
                    <div class="slide-tag">규정 검토</div>
                    <h2 class="slide-title">보수의 종류 및 <span>성과연봉의 정의</span></h2>
                    <p class="slide-desc">내부 보수규정에 명시된 구조적 정의와 지급 원칙 (클릭 시 상세 내용 토글)</p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-2">
                    <div class="accordion-wrapper" data-aos="fade-right">
                        <div class="accordion-item active">
                            <div class="accordion-header">
                                <span><i class="fas fa-gavel" style="margin-right:10px; color:var(--kepco-blue);"></i>제3조 (보수의 종류)</span>
                                <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-content" style="max-height: 200px;">
                                <div class="accordion-content-inner">
                                    직원의 보수는 <strong>기본급여, 가산급, 법정수당, 성과연봉</strong> 및 퇴직급여로 구성됩니다. 성과 연동형 보수가 독립적인 항목으로 뚜렷하게 정의되어 있음을 알 수 있습니다.
                                </div>
                            </div>
